{
 "slug": "rekki-alternative",
 "pageId": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
 "text_batches": [
  [
   {
    "label": "t0",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "c3df870f-ba8c-9aaf-796c-bb1249eeefa3"
     },
     "text": "20-30 Min"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t1",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fe9d"
     },
     "text": "Saved on each order that skips the phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t2",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "3027ca32-6180-79a6-1a66-d9f911e27a08"
     },
     "text": "24-48 Hrs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t3",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fea2"
     },
     "text": "Is how long setup takes for most distributors"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t4",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "448bf1fe-361f-3c13-6268-4572092953ba"
     },
     "text": "24/7"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t5",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5feac"
     },
     "text": "Is when orders can arrive"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t6",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "1cd5e3b3-4adf-89d2-b8a1-ba35fe69754d"
     },
     "text": "Why Teams Compare"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t7",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8be"
     },
     "text": "Why distributors weigh an alternative to REKKI"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t8",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8c2"
     },
     "text": "People hunting for a REKKI competitor rarely doubt REKKI's AI. Their worry is usually about the orders it has to read, and that can be fixed with REKKI's tools left running."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t9",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "eb7fd825-30c6-7275-9a2f-c98f68eb960f"
     },
     "text": "Reading orders by software has an error rate"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t10",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8cc"
     },
     "text": "REKKI publishes its error rate. There is a rate because software is working out what each order said, and REKKI backs it with double checks and a refund guarantee. When the customer builds the order from a guide and reviews it first, nobody has to piece it together from a message later."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t11",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "bacfcf90-d337-55e1-9a02-49b2f6962e16"
     },
     "text": "Their AI learns your business"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t12",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8d3"
     },
     "text": "Their site says your team trains it to fit your business, and that it starts processing orders and learning right away. That gives you real control. With our app, we set up every account from the order guides you already have."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t13",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "83921d0d-4ec1-911e-4420-fee5bfd13614"
     },
     "text": "Messy orders keep coming in"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t14",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8da"
     },
     "text": "Software that reads a sloppy message well stays busy, because those messages keep coming. For some accounts, you would rather they stopped sending messages entirely. Our app can take those accounts while REKKI handles the rest."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t15",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "f5b08e4d-7503-2dae-cdd2-6f455d9fe83d"
     },
     "text": "What a REKKI alternative adds before the order is sent"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t16",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "f49b7c29-2a8e-b047-d714-742b52e0a34c"
     },
     "text": "What You Get"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t17",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "d4031fde-2fc3-b283-bb1c-784e741d725b"
     },
     "text": "Voice Ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t18",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0ed"
     },
     "text": "Picked from a list, not worked out from a message"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t19",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0f1"
     },
     "text": "A chef says what is running low and the items appear from that account's own guide, carrying your codes and your prices. The customer looks over every line and fixes anything wrong before it sends, so nobody at your end pieces the order together afterwards."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t20",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4133"
     },
     "text": "Every line is on screen before it goes anywhere"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t21",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4139"
     },
     "text": "From a walk-in or a bench, whenever the shift ends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t22",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe413f"
     },
     "text": "Saves 20 to 30 minutes compared with the same order by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t23",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4145"
     },
     "text": "Reps stop writing up reorders from accounts on the app, so that time goes into selling"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t24",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "d5d6538b-4114-51aa-7fff-aad875b7bfe3"
     },
     "text": "Order Guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t25",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea2"
     },
     "text": "Every line comes from that customer's guide"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t26",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea6"
     },
     "text": "Each account works from the lines it actually buys, at the price you set for that customer. What reaches you is in your own items and codes, because each line is drawn from the guide you set up."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t27",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdead"
     },
     "text": "Lines arrive under your own codes"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t28",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb3"
     },
     "text": "The catalog and the pricing stay yours to set"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t29",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb9"
     },
     "text": "Change a guide once and the next order carries it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t30",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdebf"
     },
     "text": "Setup starts from your existing guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t31",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "6555f9fc-4dcc-b940-f384-6001ce4db69f"
     },
     "text": "Delivery Formats"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t32",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb118"
     },
     "text": "Delivered in a format your office knows"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t33",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb11c"
     },
     "text": "A finished order goes out as an email carrying a PDF, Excel or Word file, or straight into your ERP over the API, over EDI, or into QuickBooks. Nothing has to be retired or rebuilt for it to arrive."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t34",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb123"
     },
     "text": "Sent to a named rep, or to the purchasing desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t35",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb129"
     },
     "text": "Over EDI, the API or QuickBooks, nobody on your team retypes it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t36",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb12f"
     },
     "text": "Carrying a number, with the date and time of sending"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t37",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb135"
     },
     "text": "Picking, billing and delivery carry on unchanged"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t38",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "099f67ce-06ef-dc92-c6e6-fdc4481f359f"
     },
     "text": "Inventory Visibility"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t39",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93a"
     },
     "text": "Stock in sight while the orders land"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t40",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93e"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions carries real-time inventory visibility tied to order activity, and the catalog updates as stock levels change. It does not replace your stock system: that stays in charge, and a demo shows how the levels connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t41",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df945"
     },
     "text": "Over everything you list, not only the quick movers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t42",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df94b"
     },
     "text": "Fewer stockout surprises on a late, heavy order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t43",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df951"
     },
     "text": "Stock numbers come from the system you count with today"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t44",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df957"
     },
     "text": "We never count or buy stock for you"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t45",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "021e8cc1-41f6-a5cc-3995-2a8c101d005c"
     },
     "text": "Keep Both"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t46",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64e7"
     },
     "text": "Where REKKI's AI and VoiceOrder Solutions each fit"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t47",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64ec"
     },
     "text": "Keeping both makes sense. Our app is not a REKKI replacement: it moves some of your accounts off sending messages at all. Whatever comes in as an email or a voicemail still needs something to read it. A REKKI alternative often turns out to mean exactly that."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t48",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da6507"
     },
     "text": "A smaller pile for REKKI to read"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t49",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da650a"
     },
     "text": "Kitchens on the app hand over a checked list rather than a message. Whatever reads the rest has less to work through."
    }
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "label": "t50",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a6d"
     },
     "text": "Keep whatever brings you new buyers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t51",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a70"
     },
     "text": "Anything that finds you customers should keep doing it. We have no marketplace and do not help you find buyers. We only handle the ordering once they are your customers."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t52",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535624"
     },
     "text": "Begin with the kitchens that phone most"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t53",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535627"
     },
     "text": "Nothing else has to change for it, so start with the few accounts that take up most of your morning, and judge it on those."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t54",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b4"
     },
     "text": "An order the customer has already checked"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t55",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b8"
     },
     "text": "Twenty minutes. The chef talks, the guide fills in the lines, and nobody at your end has to guess what they meant."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t56",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "6923bf1d-5310-eba9-bcb8-7266c5f85e97"
     },
     "text": "Getting Started"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t57",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ec7"
     },
     "text": "Three steps, starting from your guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t58",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "38293a1d-fb4c-9501-8014-28855f9128b6"
     },
     "text": "There is nothing to train: we set it up from your order guides. You send the guides, we open the accounts, the orders start arriving finished."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t59",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ed6"
     },
     "text": "Hand the guides over"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t60",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5eda"
     },
     "text": "A spreadsheet will do. Items and the price per account go into one admin screen, under the codes you already use."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t61",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ede"
     },
     "text": "We set each account up"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t62",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ee3"
     },
     "text": "Logins are created and the kitchen downloads the app. Most send an order in before the day is over."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t63",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f00"
     },
     "text": "They arrive confirmed"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t64",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f04"
     },
     "text": "Your customer has signed it off, and it comes numbered and timed, in the layout your office asked for."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t65",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a176"
     },
     "text": "REKKI with VoiceOrder Solutions added."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t66",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "0c6cf9c7-bbe3-a64d-76b9-1539a90ac7c8"
     },
     "text": "Fewer messages to figure out."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t67",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "7b8acd63-aca8-b070-4eb6-f64ce47abebc"
     },
     "text": "REKKI Today, And With Our App"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t68",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a179"
     },
     "text": "Our app only adds to what you have. Teams looking at a REKKI alternative usually want to know if software still has to work out what each order says. Each row shows REKKI today, and REKKI with our app beside it. The two products are not linked, and every REKKI detail is from their own site."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t69",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "1ff87819-9b94-6168-dfbb-e81fd6a5b236"
     },
     "text": "Feature"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t70",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a18d"
     },
     "text": "REKKI + VoiceOrder Solutions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t71",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a19e"
     },
     "text": "REKKI on its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t72",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1be"
     },
     "text": "AI that reads orders from every channel"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t73",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1c8"
     },
     "text": "Some accounts send lines from their own guide, not a message"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t74",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1d5"
     },
     "text": "Your customer signs off the order before it sends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t75",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1e2"
     },
     "text": "AI that flags urgent emails in your inbox"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t76",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1ec"
     },
     "text": "A customer's menu scanned for products they don't buy from you yet"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t77",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1f6"
     },
     "text": "REKKI's free app for chefs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t78",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a210"
     },
     "text": "A marketplace for new buyers, UK only by their FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t79",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a21a"
     },
     "text": "Chef-app orders reach you even if you never signed up"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t80",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a224"
     },
     "text": "Orders delivered into your ERP"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t81",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "30f8c397-6bf9-f190-2eb1-183dc2b44d9e"
     },
     "text": "FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t82",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf956"
     },
     "text": "Better than REKKI, or something to use beside it?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t83",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "8bf0eb84-6a8d-dd56-6a0e-8116d9416d3d"
     },
     "text": "Is VoiceOrder Solutions a REKKI alternative, or something to add?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t84",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf967"
     },
     "text": "One to add, not swap. REKKI automates the work your office does on orders that have already arrived, plus the inbox and the upselling. We change the way one group of customers orders, so less of that work exists. REKKI's tools can stay on the rest."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t85",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "ad9f0390-a776-7031-a95b-984cd1988c9e"
     },
     "text": "Is the voice app more accurate than REKKI?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t86",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf973"
     },
     "text": "We don't claim a better percentage. Our safeguard is different: every line is picked from the account's guide, and the customer checks each one before sending. REKKI's number measures how well a machine reads an order a person wrote. Ours is a different kind of check, not a higher score."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t87",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "e219e293-819b-221b-6d80-7f8d2898a4d7"
     },
     "text": "So can an order still be wrong?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t88",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf97f"
     },
     "text": "Of course. Somebody can confirm the wrong quantity, as they can on any order ever placed. What changes is who reads the lines last: the person who wants the goods, before anything leaves. This only covers orders placed in our app: a call or a voicemail to your desk gets no number, no timestamp and no stock update."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t89",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "39590628-381c-9aea-6095-0746f7348939"
     },
     "text": "Does your app connect to REKKI?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t90",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf98b"
     },
     "text": "No. There is no link between the two and no joint support. REKKI's OrderAI, their order-reading software, keeps passing what it reads into your system, and our orders come separately, emailed as a file or sent in over EDI or the API."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t91",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "0f73d180-08e9-596f-f264-a95de40f9593"
     },
     "text": "Some of our customers already use the REKKI app. What happens?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t92",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "7e541655-5a68-8f96-1273-8249a5c759bd"
     },
     "text": "Nothing breaks. REKKI's chef app is free. REKKI says it sends orders to suppliers even if the supplier has not joined REKKI, by turning them into emails to your order address. Those keep arriving as they do now. Give our app to the accounts who prefer speaking to typing, and leave the ones already happy where they are."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t93",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "d9956fbb-a3d6-4b04-b3ab-98b6f5ae509f"
     },
     "text": "How do the costs compare?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t94",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "4446ea80-4c7a-f2a8-f0de-0a222818c94f"
     },
     "text": "They are more open about price than we are, and that deserves saying: their site shows a starting price per customer and what it includes. The price is in pounds. Their marketplace is described as UK only, but the app is described as working anywhere in the world. Ours is quote-based and nothing is published, so ask and you will get a figure for the voice step on its own."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t95",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "93ba65b0-4eb0-c64e-d0c0-933cd7a92b1d"
     },
     "text": "How fast could this be running?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t96",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf997"
     },
     "text": "Most distributors are running it in 24 to 48 hours, and most kitchens place a first order the same day. Nothing in REKKI is touched or rewired, which matters if you came looking for a REKKI alternative with only one problem to settle."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t97",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-990427524516"
     },
     "text": "Where do the REKKI details on this page come from?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t98",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6c8b1e86523e69bf86",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-99042752451e"
     },
     "text": "Taken from rekki.com, as of 10 October 2026: the AI tool descriptions, the accuracy and training wording, the published starting price and the chef app questions. Their performance figures are their own and are not quoted here as results. If any of it has moved on, the mistake is at our end."
    }
   }
  ]
 ],
